      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.3",
      "title": "Coif",
      "body": "A helmet must have a quilted, or padded, coif inside, or a leather suspension system with a quilted coif.\nThe recommended minimum thickness of the coif is 5 mm.",
