    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.5",
      "title": "Neck Protection",
      "body": "A neck protection is mandatory and must cover the neck in any position.\nThis protection can be made of metal plates sewn to the pellerine and hidden by an aventail.\nIt is recommended to wear a neck protection attached to the gambeson.\nNeck protection must conform to the “Neck Protection” document.",
