    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "5.4",
      "title": "Hands",
      "body": "Both hands must be protected with gauntlets or plate mittens.\n\nGauntlets and mittens must conform to the “Gauntlets” document.\n\nChainmail can be used only as an additional element or as an articulation of plate elements.\n\nGauntlets with separate fingers are not allowed in any category.\n\nIt is allowed to lock the gauntlet in closed-position with a leather strap or any locking system based on historical source.\n\nIt is not allowed to use gauntlets that can’t be opened in any way. Such gauntlets can be found under many names, including “torpedo”, “hoof”, “fist” etc. Except for the Longsword Duels Category.",
      "page_from": 8,
      "page_to": 8,
      "stable_key": "armor-requirements:5.4",
