    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "5.5",
      "title": "Arms",
      "body": "Arms must be protected with metal plate armor.\n\nUnder-shield forearms can be left unprotected if the shield covers the entire forearm.\n\nIt is recommended to wear full arms protection in the Buhurt category, even if the shield covers the forearm.",
