    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "5.7",
      "title": "Legs",
      "body": "Legs must be protected with metal plate armor.\n\nLeg armor can leave the back of the leg unprotected.\n\nIt is recommended to wear leg armor with full cover of the back of the leg in Buhurt categories.\n\nIt is recommended to wear padded chausses to cover the open areas.\n\nIt is allowed to wear only a pair of pants. Such a pair of pants must conform to the “Textiles and Leather” document .\n\nKnee pads or knee braces must be concealed.",
      "page_from": 9,
      "page_to": 9,
