    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "5.9",
      "title": "Shoes",
      "body": "Modern shoes are not permitted.\n\nOnly replicas of medieval shoes are allowed.\n\nFlat rubber soles with low profile texture are permitted to replace historical soles.\n\nShoes must conform to the “Textiles and Leather” document.",
