      "body": "This will be the change log of this document. It will be updated regularly and we will display what has been removed/added/reworded/formatted. This way we keep transparent communication and clarity about the rules\n\nJanuary - 2026 (V. 26.1) Formatting redone for consistency and readability. Except points listed below, no content changes.\nReplace:\n- In 4.5. Neck Protection: “Neck protection must conform to the Authenticity Rules document.” by “Neck protection must conform to the “Neck Protection” document.”\n- In 5.8. Feet: “Sabatons must conform to the Authenticity Rules document.” by “Sabatons must conform to the “Sabatons” document.”\n\nDate update: February 2025 (V2025.02)\n- add: 3.3: Pelvis: Ball joint of Hip, Groin, tailbone\n- add: 5.6: All joints (shoulders, elbows,hips, knees, wrists) must be sufficiently protected with metal plate armor.\n\nDate update: December 2024\n- add: Document created",
